{"4546950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SupercarKickers", "steam_appid": 4546950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SupercarKickers is a top-down car soccer game where speed, precision, and teamwork decide the winner. Take control of fast supercars, compete on asphalt arenas and kick the giant ball into your opponent’s goal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>Realistic car handling and ball physics make every touch count. With no power-ups or randomness, SupercarKickers is all about pure driving skill, precise control and smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/689c0150dd641e152f36274b961c8d2f.poster.avif?t=1780844036\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/689c0150dd641e152f36274b961c8d2f.webm?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/689c0150dd641e152f36274b961c8d2f.mp4?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impact &amp; Visual Damage</strong><br>Feel every collision as cars crash, bump, and battle for control. Impacts leave visible damage on your vehicle, adding intensity and making every hit look as powerful as it feels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/38c94527f85542bc1d7384f1b7aa0909.poster.avif?t=1780844036\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/38c94527f85542bc1d7384f1b7aa0909.webm?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/38c94527f85542bc1d7384f1b7aa0909.mp4?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Couch Multiplayer</strong><br>Play 1v1, 2v2, 3v3 or 4v4 matches on the same PC. Perfect for parties, rivalries and chaotic fun with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/5f08fdd77bec3d374014e0313efd3ed4.poster.avif?t=1780844036\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/5f08fdd77bec3d374014e0313efd3ed4.webm?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/5f08fdd77bec3d374014e0313efd3ed4.mp4?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Mode</strong><br>Challenge friends in  1v1 online matches and prove your skills in pure, head-to-head competition.<br>Search for public games via Lobby Browser or join with private Lobby Codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo “Highscore Attack” mode to sharpen your skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for improving your driving techniques or warming up before intense matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/4de506b72a3e5992210305ff21a80ecd.poster.avif?t=1780844036\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/4de506b72a3e5992210305ff21a80ecd.webm?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/4de506b72a3e5992210305ff21a80ecd.mp4?t=1780844036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match Customization</strong><br>Choose match lengths of 3, 5, 8, or 10 minutes to fit any playstyle. From quick matches to longer, strategic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play for Your Country</strong><br>Pick your favorite country and represent it on the field. Your flag is displayed on your car roof as you compete for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your engine and jump into fast, chaotic matches full of pure fun, intense action and unforgettable goals!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SupercarKickers is a top-down car soccer game where speed, precision, and teamwork decide the winner. Take control of fast supercars, compete on asphalt arenas and kick the giant ball into your opponent’s goal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>Realistic car handling and ball physics make every touch count. With no power-ups or randomness, SupercarKickers is all about pure driving skill, precise control and smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/689c0150dd641e152f36274b961c8d2f.poster.avif?t=1780844036\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546950/extras/689c0150dd